levushei_serad.en:
This is the name of Hashem’s people, and Hashem’s mercy is upon him, when I pray to him to return to the end of the Lord’s Prayer
So, there are no sides of his face as the so-called “foreign” name, but the phosphors share it, and therefore the G-d has ended before him. &quot;Modo Daooy&quot;
